tieng_Anh:
The Battle Phase.
During this Phase, you can attack once with each @6monster in Attack Position@0.
If there is a monster on your opponent's side of the field, select a monster to attack. If your opponent does not have any monsters on the field, you can @2attack directly@0.
When ending this phase, choose to proceed to @4Main Phase 2@0 or the @4End Phase@0.
The Battle Phase is broken down into 4 steps:
@6Start Step@0
@2Battle Step@0
@1Damage Step@0
@3End Step@0

tieng_Viet_hien_tai:
Battle Phase.
Trong Phase này, mỗi @6quái thú ở Attack Position@0 của bạn có thể Attack 1 lần.
Nếu Opponent có Monster trên Field, hãy chọn 1 Monster để Attack. Nếu Opponent không có Monster nào trên Field, bạn có thể @2Direct Attack.@0
Khi kết thúc phase này, chọn chuyển sang @4Main Phase 2@0 hoặc @4End Phase.@0
Battle Phase gồm 4 step:
@6Start Step@0
@2Battle Step@0
@1Damage Step@0
@3End Step@0
